# One rule, stated once: every text file is LF in the blob and LF on checkout.
#
# Ruled 2026-09-05 (halheinrich/Math#50); `../VISION.md` § Conventions carries
# the reasoning. `.editorconfig` states the same rule to the editor at `[*]`,
# because two mechanisms need the answer — git at checkout, the editor while
# writing — and they must say the same thing.
#
# No per-extension exceptions, deliberately. This member never carried any: it
# was created after that ruling, so there is no list here that once diverged
# and no conversion to record. The reason not to introduce one now is the
# reason the ruling gives — a list of extensions is written here and again in
# `.editorconfig`, and a list kept in two files cannot be kept in sync, only
# re-diverged.
* text=auto eol=lf
